Every physical-therapy can improve a pain and can improve a function without a serious-harm-risk.
If a patient has a knee-osteoarthritis then a weight-loss can improve a pain and can improve a function without a serious-harm-risk.
Every behavioral-therapy can improve a pain and can improve a function without a serious-harm-risk.
A behavioral-therapy-example includes a cognitive-behavioral-therapy-example and includes a mindfulness-based-stress-reduction-example.
